{"seq":1,"slug":"readme-and-api-docs","title":"README 与 API 文档","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/english-writing-practice/technical-documentation/readme-and-api-docs","wordCount":1188,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"readme-与-api-文档\">README 与 API 文档</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>README 和 API 文档是开源项目和技术产品的&quot;门面&quot;。README 是用户接触项目的第一个文件，决定了他们是否愿意继续深入；API 文档则是开发者集成产品时的核心参考。两者都需要用清晰、准确的英文写作，因为技术文档的读者通常来自全球各地。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[用户发现项目] --&gt; B[阅读 README]&#10;    B --&gt; C{是否感兴趣?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[查看 API 文档]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| E[离开]&#10;    D --&gt; F{文档是否清晰?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[开始集成]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[提 Issue 或离开]\">graph TD\n    A[用户发现项目] --&gt; B[阅读 README]\n    B --&gt; C{是否感兴趣?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[查看 API 文档]\n    C --&gt;|否| E[离开]\n    D --&gt; F{文档是否清晰?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[开始集成]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[提 Issue 或离开]</pre><p>README 和 API 文档在目标和写法上有本质区别：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>README</th>\n<th>API 文档</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核心受众</td>\n<td>潜在用户、贡献者</td>\n<td>集成开发者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首要目标</td>\n<td>说服 + 快速上手</td>\n<td>精确参考</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语气</td>\n<td>友好、鼓舞</td>\n<td>精确、客观</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>更新频率</td>\n<td>每次大版本</td>\n<td>每次 API 变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长度</td>\n<td>100-300 行</td>\n<td>按端点/模块组织</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键元素</td>\n<td>一句话描述、安装、示例</td>\n<td>端点、参数、返回值、错误码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>无论是 README 还是 API 文档，核心原则是 <code>Don&#39;t make me think</code> — 让读者用最少的认知负担获取所需信息。</p>\n<h2 id=\"readme-的黄金结构\">README 的黄金结构</h2><p>一个优秀的 README 遵循 <code>HIQSA</code> 结构：<strong>H</strong>ook（钩子）、<strong>I</strong>nstallation（安装）、<strong>Q</strong>uick Start（快速开始）、<strong>S</strong>ections（详细章节）、<strong>A</strong>ppendix（附录）。</p>\n<p><strong>Hook</strong> — 项目名称 + 一句话描述 + 徽章：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<h1 id=\"fastcache\">🚀 FastCache</h1><p>A blazing-fast, zero-dependency in-memory cache for Node.js with TTL support and LRU eviction.</p>\n<p><img src=\"badge\" alt=\"npm version\"> <img src=\"badge\" alt=\"CI\"> <img src=\"badge\" alt=\"License: MIT\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>一句话描述应遵循 <code>What it is + Key differentiator + Target platform</code> 的公式。避免空泛的描述如 <code>A useful library for caching</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>Installation</strong> — 提供所有主流包管理器的安装命令：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"installation\">Installation</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm install fastcache&#10;# or&#10;yarn add fastcache&#10;# or&#10;pnpm add fastcache\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fastcache</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># or</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">yarn</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fastcache</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># or</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fastcache</span></span></code></pre></div></blockquote>\n<p><strong>Quick Start</strong> — 用最少的代码展示核心功能，让读者在 30 秒内看到效果：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"quick-start\">Quick Start</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { createCache } from &#39;fastcache&#39;;&#10;&#10;const cache = createCache({ ttl: 60_000 });&#10;cache.set(&#39;user:1&#39;, { name: &#39;Alice&#39; });&#10;console.log(cache.get(&#39;user:1&#39;)); // { name: &#39;Alice&#39; }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createCache } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'fastcache'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cache</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createCache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ ttl: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60_000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cache.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user:1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cache.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user:1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// { name: 'Alice' }</span></span></code></pre></div></blockquote>\n<p>Quick Start 代码应该是可以直接复制粘贴运行的，不需要额外配置。</p>\n<p><strong>Sections</strong> — 根据项目复杂度，可以包含 API Reference、Configuration、Contributing 等章节。</p>\n<p><strong>Appendix</strong> — License、Changelog 链接、致谢等。</p>\n<h2 id=\"api-文档的端点描述模式\">API 文档的端点描述模式</h2><p>API 文档的核心单元是 <code>endpoint description</code>（端点描述）。每个端点应包含以下信息：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"create-user\">Create User</h3><p>Creates a new user account.</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"POST /api/v2/users\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>POST /api/v2/users</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Headers</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Header</th>\n<th>Type</th>\n<th>Required</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Authorization</code></td>\n<td><code>string</code></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Bearer token</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Content-Type</code></td>\n<td><code>string</code></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>Must be <code>application/json</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Request Body</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Alice Chen&quot;,&#10;  &quot;email&quot;: &quot;alice@example.com&quot;,&#10;  &quot;role&quot;: &quot;developer&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Alice Chen\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"alice@example.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"developer\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Response (201 Created)</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;id&quot;: &quot;usr_abc123&quot;,&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Alice Chen&quot;,&#10;  &quot;email&quot;: &quot;alice@example.com&quot;,&#10;  &quot;role&quot;: &quot;developer&quot;,&#10;  &quot;created_at&quot;: &quot;2024-03-15T10:30:00Z&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"usr_abc123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Alice Chen\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"alice@example.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"developer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"created_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2024-03-15T10:30:00Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Error Responses</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Status</th>\n<th>Code</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>400</td>\n<td><code>INVALID_EMAIL</code></td>\n<td>Email format is invalid</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>409</td>\n<td><code>USER_EXISTS</code></td>\n<td>A user with this email already exists</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>422</td>\n<td><code>MISSING_FIELD</code></td>\n<td>Required field is missing</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</blockquote>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 端点描述结构&#10;        A[方法 + 路径] --&gt; B[描述]&#10;        B --&gt; C[请求参数]&#10;        C --&gt; D[请求体示例]&#10;        D --&gt; E[响应示例]&#10;        E --&gt; F[错误码]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 端点描述结构\n        A[方法 + 路径] --&gt; B[描述]\n        B --&gt; C[请求参数]\n        C --&gt; D[请求体示例]\n        D --&gt; E[响应示例]\n        E --&gt; F[错误码]\n    end</pre><p>关键写作原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个端点的描述用一句话概括，以动词开头：<code>Creates...</code>、<code>Retrieves...</code>、<code>Deletes...</code></li>\n<li>参数表格必须标注 <code>Required</code> 还是 <code>Optional</code></li>\n<li>所有示例使用真实数据格式，不要用 <code>foo</code>、<code>bar</code> 等占位符</li>\n<li>错误码使用 <code>SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE</code>，并提供人类可读的描述</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"技术写作的语态与时态\">技术写作的语态与时态</h2><p>技术文档中的语态选择直接影响可读性和专业度。核心规则是：</p>\n<p>**使用主动语态（active voice）**描述操作和指令：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The function returns a promise that resolves with the user object.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>而非被动语态：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>A promise that resolves with the user object is returned by the function.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>**使用祈使语气（imperative mood）**写操作步骤：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Install the package using npm. Configure the database connection. Run the migration script.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>而非：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>You should install the package using npm. The database connection should be configured.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>时态规则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>时态</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>描述功能行为</td>\n<td>一般现在时</td>\n<td><code>The cache expires entries after the TTL.</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>操作指令</td>\n<td>祈使语气</td>\n<td><code>Set the TTL value in milliseconds.</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本变更说明</td>\n<td>一般过去时</td>\n<td><code>Added support for Redis backend.</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已知问题</td>\n<td>一般现在时</td>\n<td><code>The library does not support clustering.</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计划特性</td>\n<td>一般将来时</td>\n<td><code>Future releases will include sharding support.</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>避免使用 <code>simply</code>、<code>just</code>、<code>obviously</code>、<code>easily</code> 等词——对新手来说，这些词暗示&quot;如果你觉得难，那是你的问题&quot;，会产生不必要的挫败感。</p>\n<h2 id=\"文档版本控制与维护\">文档版本控制与维护</h2><p>技术文档的一大痛点是与代码不同步。解决这个问题需要建立文档维护的流程和规范。</p>\n<p>文档版本控制的最佳实践：</p>\n<p>在 README 中明确标注文档对应的版本：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This documentation is for FastCache v2.x. For v1.x docs, see <a href=\"link\">v1 branch</a>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>API 文档中使用版本前缀：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"api-reference-v2\">API Reference (v2)</h2><p>Base URL: <code>https://api.example.com/v2</code></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>当 API 发生 breaking change 时，在文档中使用明确的 deprecation notice：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>⚠️ <strong>Deprecated</strong>: The <code>GET /users/:id/profile</code> endpoint is deprecated and will be removed in v3. Use <code>GET /users/:id</code> instead, which now includes profile data in the response.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>文档维护的 checklist：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每次 PR 如果涉及公开 API 变更，必须同时更新对应文档</li>\n<li>README 的 Quick Start 代码每季度验证一次是否仍可运行</li>\n<li>定期检查文档中的外部链接是否失效</li>\n<li>新增的配置项必须在 Configuration 章节中记录</li>\n</ul>\n<p>为文档建立 <code>freshness indicator</code>：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Last updated: March 15, 2024 | Applies to: v2.3.0+</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>这让读者能快速判断文档的时效性。过时的文档比没有文档更危险——它会导致开发者基于错误的信息进行集成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((README 与 API 文档))&#10;    README&#10;      HIQSA 结构&#10;      一句话 Hook&#10;      可运行的 Quick Start&#10;    API 文档&#10;      端点描述模式&#10;      参数表格&#10;      错误码文档&#10;    写作规范&#10;      主动语态&#10;      祈使语气&#10;      时态一致&#10;    版本维护&#10;      版本标注&#10;      Deprecation Notice&#10;      Freshness Indicator\">mindmap\n  root((README 与 API 文档))\n    README\n      HIQSA 结构\n      一句话 Hook\n      可运行的 Quick Start\n    API 文档\n      端点描述模式\n      参数表格\n      错误码文档\n    写作规范\n      主动语态\n      祈使语气\n      时态一致\n    版本维护\n      版本标注\n      Deprecation Notice\n      Freshness Indicator</pre><ul>\n<li>README 使用 <code>HIQSA</code> 结构：Hook、Installation、Quick Start、Sections、Appendix</li>\n<li>一句话描述遵循 <code>What + Differentiator + Platform</code> 公式</li>\n<li>API 端点描述包含：方法路径、描述、参数、请求体、响应、错误码</li>\n<li>使用主动语态和祈使语气，避免被动和 <code>you should</code> 句式</li>\n<li>避免 <code>simply</code>、<code>just</code>、<code>obviously</code> 等贬低读者难度感知的词</li>\n<li>文档标注版本号和最后更新日期，建立 freshness indicator</li>\n<li>breaking change 必须使用 deprecation notice 提前告知</li>\n<li>每次涉及公开 API 的 PR 必须同步更新文档</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"README 与 API 文档","id":"readme-与-api-文档"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"README 的黄金结构","id":"readme-的黄金结构"},{"level":1,"text":"🚀 FastCache","id":"fastcache"},{"level":2,"text":"Installation","id":"installation"},{"level":2,"text":"Quick Start","id":"quick-start"},{"level":2,"text":"API 文档的端点描述模式","id":"api-文档的端点描述模式"},{"level":3,"text":"Create User","id":"create-user"},{"level":2,"text":"技术写作的语态与时态","id":"技术写作的语态与时态"},{"level":2,"text":"文档版本控制与维护","id":"文档版本控制与维护"},{"level":2,"text":"API Reference (v2)","id":"api-reference-v2"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"邮件线程管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/english-writing-practice/email-mastery/email-thread-management"},"next":{"title":"代码注释与提交信息","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/english-writing-practice/technical-documentation/code-comments-and-commits"}}